                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c7e05c4e-c550-3d7c-8853-bfe44fd437bb",
                        "entry_id": "b8bbafee-b7ca-375b-86b8-4932482eeae7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Obsolete form of serene (“fine rain from a cloudless sky after sunset”, noun)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "alt-of",
                            "obsolete",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fbc3b35f-8b8b-414c-a4ed-d9cf38f709dc",
                                "sense_id": "c7e05c4e-c550-3d7c-8853-bfe44fd437bb",
                                "text": "Fie, fie, was euer poore fellow so farre benighted in an old wiues tale of diuells and vrchins. Out vpon it, I am wearie of it, for it hath caused such a thicke fulsome Serena to descend on my braine, that now my penne makes blots as broad as a furd stomacher, and my muse inspyres me to put out my candle and goe to bed:[…]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3d838f84-d84a-489e-834c-bc8aca71d496",
                                "sense_id": "c7e05c4e-c550-3d7c-8853-bfe44fd437bb",
                                "text": "But not desirous to make any longer aboad in this place, by reason of the most infectious serenas or dewes that fall all along these coasts of Africa,[…]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d3fe47d2-f011-44c1-bd6f-7f640a04447b",
                                "sense_id": "c7e05c4e-c550-3d7c-8853-bfe44fd437bb",
                                "text": "For indeed they had already by way of Precaution, armed themselves against the Serena with a Caudle."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
